        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin LAJ-CSR, La Jolla Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe La Jolla Handleset with Square Rosette is made out of solid brass, making this high quality piece able to stand the test of time. Baldwin has long been a leader in design and craftsmanship and the La Jolla Handleset is a beautifully modern addition to the Reserve Collection. The La Jolla Handleset with Contemporary Square Rose is available in a standard single cylinder function; but you may also choose a dummy function or a double cylinder function. This handleset comes with an adjustable latch that will fit 2-3/4 inch backsets and 2-3/8 inch backsets. It will fit 1-3/4 inch up to 2-1/2 inch thick doors. Choose from your favorite interior trim knob or lever. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the La Jolla Handleset with Contemporary Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt tested to exceed ANSI-BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Modern La Jolla Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Height: 3-11/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Width: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Length (without deadbolt): 12-15/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Length center to center (without deadbolt): 8-13/32\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Width: 2-19/32\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Standard: 1-3/4\" - 2\" </li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Optional:  1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" or 2\" - 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "La Jolla Handleset with Square Rosette",
                "description": "The La Jolla Handleset with Square Rosette is made out of solid brass, making this high quality piece able to stand the test of time. Baldwin has long been a leader in design and craftsmanship and the La Jolla Handleset is a beautifully modern addition to the Reserve Collection. The La Jolla Handleset with Contemporary Square Rose is available in a standard single cylinder function; but you may also choose a dummy function or a double cylinder function. This handleset comes with an adjustable latch that will fit 2-3/4 inch backsets and 2-3/8 inch backsets. It will fit 1-3/4 inch up to 2-1/2 inch thick doors. Choose from your favorite interior trim knob or lever.",
                "keywords": "Contemporary entry sets, Contemporary handlesets, Modern front door entry sets, Modern entry sets, Modern handlesets, Modern front door entry sets, baldwin reserve collection entrance trim sets, grade 2 handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, Baldwin Reserve La Jolla Handleset with Square Rosettes, BAL-xxLAJSQUCSR, Baldwin La Jolla Entryset with Square Roses, Baldwin LAJ-CSR, BAL-LAJ-CSR, La Jolla Handleset with Contemporary Square Roses, La Jolla Handlesets, Baldwin Reserve Modern La Jolla Entrance Sets,"
